  "description": "MessagePack serializer for CachingFramework.Redis, a distributed caching based on StackExchange.Redis and Redis. Includes support for all redis data types, tagging mechanism, cache invalidation, PubSub, GeoSpatial indexes, HyperLogLog and is cluster-compatible.\n\t\t\tThis uses MessagePack for C# which requires annotations on the objects you want to save in Redis. You can read more about serialization using MessagePack in https://github.com/neuecc/MessagePack-CSharp#readme",
